WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.936
"Rex, catch!" Sara said.

2
00:00:10.937 --> 00:00:15.179
She threw a big nut.

3
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:20.608
Rex caught the nut.

4
00:00:20.609 --> 00:00:22.730
He threw it to Sid.

5
00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:25.460
The nut went over Sid's head.

6
00:00:25.461 --> 00:00:31.931
Rex grinned. "Sorry, Sid!"

7
00:00:31.932 --> 00:00:37.554
"Ugh!" Sid said. "Not again!"

8
00:00:37.555 --> 00:00:42.457
Sid ran after the nut.

9
00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:46.064
Tor flew down from the sky.

10
00:00:46.065 --> 00:00:50.113
"I found a really big pond!" she said.

11
00:00:50.114 --> 00:00:52.448
"Want to see it?"

12
00:00:52.449 --> 00:01:01.541
"Yes!" Rex and Sara said.

13
00:01:01.542 --> 00:01:05.549
"Is it far?" Sid asked.

14
00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:09.593
Tor nodded. "Very far."

15
00:01:09.594 --> 00:01:16.697
"Ugh," Sid said.

16
00:01:16.698 --> 00:01:20.265
The buddies walked and walked.

17
00:01:20.266 --> 00:01:24.710
"Are we there yet?" Sid asked.

18
00:01:24.711 --> 00:01:30.971
"Nope!" Tor said.

19
00:01:30.972 --> 00:01:37.656
They walked across a field.

20
00:01:37.657 --> 00:01:50.003
They walked over a mountain.

21
00:01:50.004 --> 00:01:53.890
"I'm tired," Sid said.

22
00:01:53.891 --> 00:01:58.602
"I can't walk anymore."

23
00:01:58.603 --> 00:02:08.036
Tor finally stopped. "There it is!"

24
00:02:08.037 --> 00:02:11.908
Rex gasped.

25
00:02:11.909 --> 00:02:14.305
Sid sat down.

26
00:02:14.306 --> 00:02:18.314
Sara laughed.

27
00:02:18.315 --> 00:02:22.642
"That's not a pond, Tor.

28
00:02:22.643 --> 00:02:26.667
That's the sea!"

